  "limitations": [
    "Country, age-band and clarification variants must be enumerated in each actual scenario dossier; this contract does not certify a full Cartesian product.",
    "Swahili has no registry sourceId; this proposed scoped roster is explicit and is not inferred from the pointer.",
    "Historical V8 proves original TXT and engine assertions only; SW TXT remains English in that historical payload.",
    "A scenario checker validates pinned dossiers and reviewer scope; it does not execute a browser or independently certify their clinical, accessibility or privacy conclusions."
  ]
